# Never upload local secret-bearing scratch files into a Vercel deployment's
# build context, regardless of .gitignore state. These have carried real
# production credentials (Supabase service_role key, JWTs) in plaintext.
env_dev.txt
env_preview.txt
env_prod.txt
vercel_env_*.txt
db_diff_*.txt
.vercel_prod_tmp/
.supabase_prod_tmp/
# 반드시 루트 앵커(/)를 붙인다 - 앞에 슬래시가 없으면 gitignore 문법상 모든 하위
# 경로에서 매칭돼(예: app/api/parent/reports/) 같은 이름의 앱 라우트 디렉터리까지
# 통째로 배포에서 빠진다. 실제로 이 버그로 /api/parent/reports/* 전체가 배포
# 빌드에서 누락되어 404가 나던 것을 발견해 수정함(017-report-check.md 작업 중
# 실배포 검증에서 재현).
/reports/

# Vercel CLI never parses .gitignore — it only reads .vercelignore plus a small
# hardcoded default list (.git, node_modules, .next, .env.local, .env.*.local, …).
# So every secret pattern that .gitignore protects from *commits* must be repeated
# here, or it ships in the deployment's build context. Mirrored from .gitignore:
*.pem
*.key
supabase/.env.secrets
*-b8beddefb7c2.json
k-bestie3-*.json
*service-account*.json
*sa-key*.json
/scratch/
.omc/
worktrees/
candidate-release/
e2e-results/
# Agent tooling state. .claude/worktrees/ holds six FULL copies of this repo —
# uploading them bloats every deployment and drags in each copy's scratch files.
.claude/
requests/_done/
requests/_failed/
requests/_log.md
requests/_blocked.md
